WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.041
Every year,

00:00:02.041 --> 00:00:03.291
we interview designers

00:00:03.291 --> 00:00:05.583
from the 99designs by Vista community

00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:07.250
and VistaPrint marketing experts

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.333
from around the world,

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:09.875
to uncover the top design

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:10.791
and marketing trends

00:00:10.791 --> 00:00:12.250
for the year to come.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:14.291
This year's packaging design trends

00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:16.875
 are all about creativity and confidence

00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:18.208
and there's something for every kind

00:00:18.208 --> 00:00:20.333
of small business wanting to experiment

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:21.625
or refresh their look.

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:22.916
Let's jump in and discover

00:00:22.916 --> 00:00:26.375
how to bring them into your branding in 2025.

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:27.833
Twisted Sustainability

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:30.416
is bright, fun and energetic.

00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:32.791
Swapping earthy tones for vibrant colors

00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:34.375
that demand attention,

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:35.625
this trend is perfect

00:00:35.625 --> 00:00:37.041
for businesses that want to show

00:00:37.041 --> 00:00:39.833
their environmental values.

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:40.708
Clever Cutouts

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:42.958
keep it simple and sophisticated,

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:44.208
using negative space

00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:46.041
to let the product shine through,

00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:48.958
piquing curiosity in just the right way.

00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:50.333
Experiment with this trend

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:52.333
by looking at your existing packaging

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:53.500
and asking what parts

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.500
could be removed

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.583
to reveal the product within.

00:00:58.375 --> 00:01:00.166
Brands are embracing a raw

00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:01.500
and human approach,

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.166
with Simplistic Scribbles and Etches,

00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:05.583
creating visuals that look like

00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:06.333
they've been drawn

00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:08.750
directly onto the package itself.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:09.750
This trend can work

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:10.916
for brands that want to show off

00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:11.958
their human side

00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:13.583
while adding some spontaneous

00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.083
energy to their look.

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:17.791
The Sunset Gradients trend is for brands

00:01:17.791 --> 00:01:20.458
looking to bring a sense of calm and warmth

00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:21.750
to their packaging.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.583
Colorful horizontal flows

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.791
create a warm and inviting aura

00:01:25.791 --> 00:01:27.750
that's perfect for wellness companies

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:29.041
and health products.

00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:32.125
Any brand that wants to be quietly eye-catching can

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:35.125
tap into this soothing aesthetic.

00:01:35.125 --> 00:01:36.166
Curated Frames

00:01:36.166 --> 00:01:37.375
elevate your design

00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:38.833
with an artist's touch.

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:40.708
Intricate drawings, paintings

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:42.208
or photography are paired

00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:44.000
with simple text and lines,

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.375
creating a refined,

00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:47.208
high-end look that places the

00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:49.500
attention-grabbing artwork center stage.

00:01:50.583 --> 00:01:52.625
The Back to Your Roots packaging trend

00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:54.458
is for brands who want to proudly

00:01:54.458 --> 00:01:55.791
embrace their heritage

00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:57.375
and add a rich backstory

00:01:57.375 --> 00:01:58.416
to their business,

00:01:58.416 --> 00:02:00.208
with illustrations and patterns

00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:02.458
that align with their tradition and culture.

00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:04.083
Try this look out by exploring

00:02:04.083 --> 00:02:05.541
your own cultural traditions

00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:07.250
and uncover the authentic story

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:09.750
behind your brand.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.166
Marker Pen Mascots

00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:13.208
are quirky, hand-drawn characters

00:02:13.208 --> 00:02:15.291
that, while simple in style,

00:02:15.291 --> 00:02:17.791
are bursting with character and charm.

00:02:17.791 --> 00:02:19.791
Snack companies, beverage brands

00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:22.083
and even health and artisan products 

00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:24.833
can benefit from this less buttoned-up approach

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:28.916
that's sure to get your customers engaged and smiling.

00:02:28.916 --> 00:02:30.708
Inspired by fruit bowl colors

00:02:30.708 --> 00:02:33.041
like lime greens, watermelon pinks

00:02:33.041 --> 00:02:34.458
and raspberry reds,

00:02:34.458 --> 00:02:36.416
Fruity Hues mixes fresh fonts

00:02:36.416 --> 00:02:37.750
and simple shapes

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.000
to create a vibrant

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.083
and tangy look

00:02:40.083 --> 00:02:41.875
that's a great fit for any brand

00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:43.666
that wants to appear approachable

00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:45.416
and practically edible.

00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:48.333
These packaging design trends for 2025

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:50.708
bring a renewed focus on personality

00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:51.958
and authenticity,

00:02:51.958 --> 00:02:53.083
with brands leaning

00:02:53.083 --> 00:02:54.833
into approachability and fun

00:02:54.833 --> 00:02:56.833
without compromising their values.

00:02:56.833 --> 00:02:58.958
To discover all the amazing design

00:02:58.958 --> 00:03:00.958
and marketing trends for 2025,

00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:02.583
head to our blog, where you'll find

00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:04.708
all our articles, plus simple

00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:06.208
and actionable steps to bring

00:03:06.208 --> 00:03:07.125
these trends to life

00:03:07.125 --> 00:03:08.208
in your own branding.

